# Visual style

Before changing UI, CSS, or assets:

1. Read `docs/style-reference/STYLE.md`
2. Check relevant images in `docs/style-reference/ui/`, `rooms/`, `sprites/`
3. Avoid looks listed under anti-patterns

Match the existing dungeon aesthetic: dark navy panels, soft mint primary actions, pixel/hand-drawn sprites on stone room art. Do not invent a new brand palette or generic “AI purple” UI.
